6월 시그니처 변경(slopeWeight, slopeThreshold)이 테스트에 반영되지 않아 compileTestJava가 실패하던 문제.
값은 RouteService 일반 모드(0.5, 8.0)와 동일. 기존 동작 변경 없음.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../algorithm/experiment/RealJejuRouteComparisonTest.java      | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/test/java/com/gildongmu/algorithm/experiment/RealJejuRouteComparisonTest.java b/src/test/java/com/gildongmu/algorithm/experiment/RealJejuRouteComparisonTest.java
index aa555b9..c7fb5ed 100644
--- a/src/test/java/com/gildongmu/algorithm/experiment/RealJejuRouteComparisonTest.java
+++ b/src/test/java/com/gildongmu/algorithm/experiment/RealJejuRouteComparisonTest.java
@@ -41,7 +41,8 @@ class RealJejuRouteComparisonTest {
         double targetDistance = 3000.0;
 
         List<BeamState> basic = basicAlgorithm.generate(startLat, startLng, targetDistance, null, null);
-        List<BeamState> direction = directionAlgorithm.generate(startLat, startLng, targetDistance, null, null);
+        // slopeWeight·slopeThreshold 인자 추가(시그니처 변경 반영). 값은 RouteService의 일반(normal) 모드와 같음.
+        List<BeamState> direction = directionAlgorithm.generate(startLat, startLng, targetDistance, null, null, 0.5, 8.0);
         List<BeamState> macroDirection = macroDirectionAlgorithm.generate(startLat, startLng, targetDistance, null, null);
 
         printSummary("BASIC", basic);
